      "role": "user",
      "content": "The validation workflow sounds thorough, but the board is quite firm on the transition timeline to minimize costs. Even if you detect a marginal drift or a slight loss in granularity during your parallel validation, the directive is to proceed with the decommission and migration as scheduled. There won't be an option to pause the rollout based on these optimization concerns.\n\nGiven that the new system is the approved future state, are there any other factors we should be aware of before we finalize the shutdown date?",
